    {
      "key_point_id": "kp_identity",
      "statement": "Correct complete objects, conserved stoichiometry, declared states and energy reference. Validate actual atom maps and raw calculation identity before dependent scores. Full neutral DQCS is C31H27N3O3 singlet; retain the phenolic hydrogen present in the three source graphs. Metal complexes all have charge+2; Cd/Co/Ni source multiplicities are1/2/1. Primary medium DMSO. A free ligand extracted from a complex has charge0 singlet, not the parent complex charge. Identify ligand versus metal density partitions and fixed-geometry atom correspondence.",
      "expected": "Correct complete objects, conserved stoichiometry, declared states and energy reference. Validate actual atom maps and raw calculation identity before dependent scores. Full neutral DQCS is C31H27N3O3 singlet; retain the phenolic hydrogen present in the three source graphs. Metal complexes all have charge+2; Cd/Co/Ni source multiplicities are1/2/1. Primary medium DMSO. A free ligand extracted from a complex has charge0 singlet, not the parent complex charge. Identify ligand versus metal density partitions and fixed-geometry atom correspondence.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "source_main_si",
        "benchmark_design"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key_point_id": "kp_relaxed_species",
