      "expected": "Compute like-defined TD/NTO observables with six roots or a justified larger window. Co transitions retain doublet reference/spin character rather than forced singlet labels. Core rows: DQCS, Cd_DQCS, Co_DQCS, Ni_DQCS. Recompute excitation_eV, oscillator_strength, metal_transition_fraction, spin_squared from the submitted linked raw outputs and numeric tables. No narrative-only control or reused old scalar receives endpoint credit.",
