      "expected": "Extract identical complete ligand graph/charge from each source complex, retaining all hydrogens; pair frozen and relaxed ligand results. Core rows: ligand_from_Cd, ligand_from_Co, ligand_from_Ni. Recompute excitation_eV, oscillator_strength, ligand_distortion_kJ_mol from the submitted linked raw outputs and numeric tables. No narrative-only control or reused old scalar receives endpoint credit.",
